              "value": 9
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You issue a cloud of your fragrance like a full-body sneeze\u2014but one that might save your life as the powerful perfume makes your attackers' eyes sting and water. Plants and fungi are immune to this effect, but all other creatures in a 10-foot emanation must attempt a Fortitude save against your class DC or spell DC (whichever is higher) with the following results.\n\nCritical Success: No effect.\nSuccess: The creature is dazzled for 1 round.\nFailure: The creature is dazzled and can see only 10 feet away for 1 round.\nCritical Failure: The creature is blinded for 1 round."
            }
          }
        }
